# session/screenshots/luaburst/
# Per-frame captures written from inside an mGBA Lua frame callback, kept out
# of version control (regenerated on demand).
#
# Expected contents (gitignored — not committed):
#   cur<frame>.bin  one dump per emulator frame (e.g. the cursor/IWRAM region),
#                   for frame-exact analysis of fast events like the CPU's turn,
#                   which a human-speed screenshot loop misses. See
#                   docs/LUA_AUTOMATION.md and docs/OPPONENT_TURN_NAVIGATION.md.
